{"about_the_game":"The Voice Visualizer allows you to visualize your voice with a personal image. Make your stream come to life without the obligation of a webcam.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The image is vibrating to the sound of your voice, to show the viewer that you are talking<br></li><li> Personalize your<strong> background</strong> with several <strong>effects</strong> and <strong>colors</strong>...<br></li><li> Or make it <strong>transparent</strong> to save some space or to have a clean layout<br></li><li> You can customize how much your voice is affecting this image<br></li><li> Create up to three <strong>profiles</strong> for several situations and adjustments<br></li><li> Present your current emotions to your audience with up to six <strong>emotes</strong></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1735480?t=1759164320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759164320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759164320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759164320","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"The Voice Visualizer allows you to visualize your voice with a personal image. Make your stream come to life without the obligation of a webcam.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The image is vibrating to the sound of your voice, to show the viewer that you are talking<br></li><li> Personalize your<strong> background</strong> with several <strong>effects</strong> and <strong>colors</strong>...<br></li><li> Or make it <strong>transparent</strong> to save some space or to have a clean layout<br></li><li> You can customize how much your voice is affecting this image<br></li><li> Create up to three <st